  "batch_edn": "{\"source\" \":agent/codex\" \"forms\" [[:db/add \"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\" :answer/id #uuid \"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\"] [:db/add \"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\" :answer/id #uuid \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\"] [:db/add \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\" :answer/id #uuid \"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\"] [:db/add \"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\" :answer/id #uuid \"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\"] [:db/add \"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\" :answer/id #uuid \"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\"] [:db/add \"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\"] [:db/add \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\"] [:db/add \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\"] [:db/add \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\"] [:db/add \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\"] [:db/add \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\"] [:db/add \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/correct \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\"] [:db/ensure \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/id #uuid \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\"] [:db/add \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/answer-fields \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\"] [:db/ensure \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\"] [:db/add \"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\" :answer/id #uuid \"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\"] [:db/add \"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\" :answer/id #uuid \"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\"] [:db/add \"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\" :answer/id #uuid \"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\"] [:db/add \"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\" :answer/id #uuid \"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\"] [:db/add \"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\" :answer/id #uuid \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\"] [:db/add \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\"] [:db/add \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\"] [:db/add \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\"] [:db/add \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\"] [:db/add \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\"] [:db/add \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\"] [:db/add \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/correct \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\"] [:db/ensure \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/id #uuid \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\"] [:db/add \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{4}{3}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/answer-fields \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\"] [:db/ensure \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\"] [:db/add \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\" :answer/id #uuid \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\"] [:db/add \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\" :answer/id #uuid \"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\"] [:db/add \"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\" :answer/id #uuid \"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\"] [:db/add \"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\" :answer/id #uuid \"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\"] [:db/add \"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\" :answer/id #uuid \"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\"] [:db/add \"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\"] [:db/add \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\"] [:db/add \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\"] [:db/add \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\"] [:db/add \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\"] [:db/add \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\"] [:db/add \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/correct \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\"] [:db/ensure \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/id #uuid \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\"] [:db/add \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{4}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/answer-fields \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\"] [:db/ensure \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\"] [:db/add \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\" :answer/id #uuid \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\"] [:db/add \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\" :answer/id #uuid \"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\"] [:db/add \"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\" :answer/id #uuid \"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\"] [:db/add \"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\" :answer/id #uuid \"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\"] [:db/add \"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\" :answer/id #uuid \"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\"] [:db/add \"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\"] [:db/add \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\"] [:db/add \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\"] [:db/add \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\"] [:db/add \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\"] [:db/add \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\"] [:db/add \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/correct \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\"] [:db/ensure \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/id #uuid \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\"] [:db/add \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/answer-fields \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\"] [:db/ensure \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\"] [:db/add \"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\" :answer/id #uuid \"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\"] [:db/add \"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\" :answer/id #uuid \"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\"] [:db/add \"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\" :answer/id #uuid \"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\"] [:db/add \"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\" :answer/id #uuid \"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\"] [:db/add \"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\" :answer/id #uuid \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\"] [:db/add \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\"] [:db/add \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\"] [:db/add \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\"] [:db/add \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\"] [:db/add \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\"] [:db/add \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\"] [:db/add \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/correct \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\"] [:db/ensure \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/id #uuid \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\"] [:db/add \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{2}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/answer-fields \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\"] [:db/ensure \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\"] [:db/add \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\" :answer/id #uuid \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\"] [:db/add \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\" :answer/id #uuid \"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\"] [:db/add \"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{8}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\" :answer/id #uuid \"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\"] [:db/add \"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\" :answer/id #uuid \"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\"] [:db/add \"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{8}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\" :answer/id #uuid \"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\"] [:db/add \"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\"] [:db/add \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\"] [:db/add \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\"] [:db/add \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\"] [:db/add \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\"] [:db/add \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\"] [:db/add \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/correct \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\"] [:db/ensure \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/id #uuid \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\"] [:db/add \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{3}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/answer-fields \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\"] [:db/ensure \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\"] [:db/add \"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\" :answer/id #uuid \"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\"] [:db/add \"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\" :answer/id #uuid \"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\"] [:db/add \"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\" :answer/id #uuid \"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\"] [:db/add \"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\" :answer/id #uuid \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\"] [:db/add \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\" :answer/id #uuid \"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\"] [:db/add \"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\"] [:db/add \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\"] [:db/add \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\"] [:db/add \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\"] [:db/add \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\"] [:db/add \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\"] [:db/add \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/correct \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\"] [:db/ensure \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/id #uuid \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\"] [:db/add \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{2}{3}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/answer-fields \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\"] [:db/ensure \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\"] [:db/add \"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\" :answer/id #uuid \"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\"] [:db/add \"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\" :answer/id #uuid \"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\"] [:db/add \"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\" :answer/id #uuid \"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\"] [:db/add \"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{5 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\" :answer/id #uuid \"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\"] [:db/add \"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{10}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\" :answer/id #uuid \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\"] [:db/add \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\"] [:db/add \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\"] [:db/add \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\"] [:db/add \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\"] [:db/add \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\"] [:db/add \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\"] [:db/add \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/correct \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\"] [:db/ensure \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/id #uuid \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\"] [:db/add \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{3}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/answer-fields \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\"] [:db/ensure \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\"] [:db/add \"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\" :answer/id #uuid \"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\"] [:db/add \"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\" :answer/id #uuid \"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\"] [:db/add \"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\" :answer/id #uuid \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\"] [:db/add \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\" :answer/id #uuid \"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\"] [:db/add \"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\" :answer/id #uuid \"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\"] [:db/add \"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\"] [:db/add \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\"] [:db/add \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\"] [:db/add \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\"] [:db/add \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\"] [:db/add \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\"] [:db/add \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/correct \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\"] [:db/ensure \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/id #uuid \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\"] [:db/add \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $6\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/answer-fields \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\"] [:db/ensure \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\"] [:db/add \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\" :answer/id #uuid \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\"] [:db/add \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\" :answer/id #uuid \"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\"] [:db/add \"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\" :answer/id #uuid \"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\"] [:db/add \"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\" :answer/id #uuid \"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\"] [:db/add \"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\" :answer/id #uuid \"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\"] [:db/add \"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\"] [:db/add \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\"] [:db/add \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\"] [:db/add \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\"] [:db/add \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\"] [:db/add \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\"] [:db/add \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/correct \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\"] [:db/ensure \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/id #uuid \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\"] [:db/add \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $4>0$, $|u|=4|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/4$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $12\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=3$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/answer-fields \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\"] [:db/ensure \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\"] [:db/add \"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\" :answer/id #uuid \"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\"] [:db/add \"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\" :answer/id #uuid \"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\"] [:db/add \"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\" :answer/id #uuid \"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\"] [:db/add \"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{5 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\" :answer/id #uuid \"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\"] [:db/add \"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\" :answer/id #uuid \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\"] [:db/add \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\"] [:db/add \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\"] [:db/add \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\"] [:db/add \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\"] [:db/add \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\"] [:db/add \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\"] [:db/add \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/correct \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\"] [:db/ensure \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/id #uuid \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\"] [:db/add \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $10\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/answer-fields \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\"] [:db/ensure \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\"] [:db/add \"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\" :answer/id #uuid \"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\"] [:db/add \"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\" :answer/id #uuid \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\"] [:db/add \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\" :answer/id #uuid \"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\"] [:db/add \"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\" :answer/id #uuid \"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\"] [:db/add \"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\" :answer/value \"8\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\" :answer/id #uuid \"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\"] [:db/add \"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\" :answer/value \"-4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\"] [:db/add \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\"] [:db/add \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\"] [:db/add \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\"] [:db/add \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\"] [:db/add \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\"] [:db/add \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/correct \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\"] [:db/ensure \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/id #uuid \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\"] [:db/add \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $4>0$, $|u|=4|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/4$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $16\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=4$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/answer-fields \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\"] [:db/ensure \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\"] [:db/add \"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\" :answer/id #uuid \"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\"] [:db/add \"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\" :answer/id #uuid \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\"] [:db/add \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\" :answer/id #uuid \"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\"] [:db/add \"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\" :answer/id #uuid \"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\"] [:db/add \"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\" :answer/id #uuid \"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\"] [:db/add \"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\"] [:db/add \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\"] [:db/add \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\"] [:db/add \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\"] [:db/add \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\"] [:db/add \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\"] [:db/add \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/correct \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\"] [:db/ensure \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/id #uuid \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\"] [:db/add \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $2>0$, $|u|=2|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/2$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/answer-fields \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\"] [:db/ensure \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\"] [:db/add \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\" :answer/id #uuid \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\"] [:db/add \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\" :answer/id #uuid \"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\"] [:db/add \"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\" :answer/id #uuid \"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\"] [:db/add \"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\" :answer/id #uuid \"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\"] [:db/add \"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}+C\"] [:db/ensure \"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\" :answer/id #uuid \"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\"] [:db/add \"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\"] [:db/add \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\"] [:db/add \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\"] [:db/add \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\"] [:db/add \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\"] [:db/add \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\"] [:db/add \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/correct \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\"] [:db/ensure \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/id #uuid \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\"] [:db/add \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/answer-fields \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\"] [:db/ensure \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\"] [:db/add \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\" :answer/id #uuid \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\"] [:db/add \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\" :answer/id #uuid \"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\"] [:db/add \"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\" :answer/id #uuid \"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\"] [:db/add \"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{5 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\" :answer/id #uuid \"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\"] [:db/add \"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\" :answer/id #uuid \"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\"] [:db/add \"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\"] [:db/add \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\"] [:db/add \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\"] [:db/add \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\"] [:db/add \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\"] [:db/add \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\"] [:db/add \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/correct \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\"] [:db/ensure \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/id #uuid \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\"] [:db/add \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $15\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=3$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/answer-fields \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\"] [:db/ensure \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\"] [:db/add \"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\" :answer/id #uuid \"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\"] [:db/add \"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\" :answer/value \"-4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\" :answer/id #uuid \"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\"] [:db/add \"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\" :answer/value \"8\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\" :answer/id #uuid \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\"] [:db/add \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\" :answer/id #uuid \"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\"] [:db/add \"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\" :answer/id #uuid \"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\"] [:db/add \"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add \"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [:db/ensure \"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\" :answer/validate] [:db/add \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\"] [:db/add \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [:db/add \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\"] [:db/add \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\"] [:db/add \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\"] [:db/add \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\"] [:db/add \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\"] [:db/add \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/correct \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\"] [:db/ensure \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/id #uuid \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\"] [:db/add \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [:db/add \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $12\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=4$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [:db/add \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/answer-fields \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\"] [:db/ensure \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"60768809-3750-51be-a9aa-ab953c38eaa5\"] [:db/add \"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/74/74e3d64ae5c839f39554d463b26744edb4168c32b82da5d6a6aaf482d1a9c804/generator.py\"] [:db/add 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"] [:db/ensure 17592186064250 :knowledge-point/validate]] \"assertions\" [[\"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\" :answer/id #uuid \"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\"] [\"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\" :answer/id #uuid \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\"] [\"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\" :answer/id #uuid \"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\"] [\"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\" :answer/id #uuid \"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\"] [\"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\" :answer/id #uuid \"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\"] [\"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\"] [\"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"50b28ccf-f304-504d-875b-5536c2114a4b\"] [\"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\"] [\"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"85630e5c-2ff2-56a6-8b01-a1fa5e1921a3\"] [\"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"d502e6d1-b306-5402-b4e3-644fccddf767\"] [\"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/choices \"36076719-3b02-5438-b142-e7333e59741b\"] [\"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\" :answer-field/correct \"ed6a018b-d5a4-58aa-83bd-4e6b7d4fc89c\"] [\"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/id #uuid \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\"] [\"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|2 x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\" :question/answer-fields \"e0b78b21-1cdb-534d-90ad-fb780f583108\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"9488c98e-2c06-5b39-b9eb-8420048bbf36\"] [\"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\" :answer/id #uuid \"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\"] [\"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\" :answer/id #uuid \"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\"] [\"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\" :answer/id #uuid \"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\"] [\"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\" :answer/id #uuid \"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\"] [\"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\" :answer/id #uuid \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\"] [\"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\"] [\"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"d03af0d7-0427-5dfc-8aa9-bf4e4ce0ae5b\"] [\"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"1f343c7a-574f-531d-95ae-d396257bc33b\"] [\"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"3849f6c9-ee5b-5405-a5d0-6f7b97aa178b\"] [\"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"591e90b2-7087-51ea-a696-f7fe7e0b492d\"] [\"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/choices \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\"] [\"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\" :answer-field/correct \"e235f3d4-d754-5287-b6b8-a8dcd28ce9bb\"] [\"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/id #uuid \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\"] [\"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{4}{3}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\" :question/answer-fields \"a098bcb9-efe7-53e5-9593-ccf0988dff34\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"4d9def4d-ec1c-5e4e-89a1-371b4cabc16f\"] [\"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\" :answer/id #uuid \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\"] [\"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\" :answer/id #uuid \"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\"] [\"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\" :answer/id #uuid \"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\"] [\"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\" :answer/id #uuid \"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\"] [\"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\" :answer/id #uuid \"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\"] [\"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{8}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\"] [\"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\"] [\"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"7c5e4a99-6018-51b0-8638-5e0e8fdeefb4\"] [\"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"45c25c28-fcc4-540d-8c0b-e92d34b3e089\"] [\"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"d4dbe2d4-0b53-5572-9e2c-c77189c45d6a\"] [\"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/choices \"68f10f90-541b-55fb-9937-a8c8b287b056\"] [\"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\" :answer-field/correct \"f6e9f071-c006-53c8-84ea-9610b3a912ef\"] [\"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/id #uuid \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\"] [\"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{4}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{4}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\" :question/answer-fields \"295d5b24-a370-5154-8380-edaf9b2583b1\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"04f71186-3d54-5f26-9518-6b9d302541bf\"] [\"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\" :answer/id #uuid \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\"] [\"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\" :answer/id #uuid \"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\"] [\"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\" :answer/id #uuid \"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\"] [\"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\" :answer/id #uuid \"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\"] [\"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\" :answer/id #uuid \"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\"] [\"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\"] [\"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\"] [\"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"2fb09e8e-8574-5657-b478-2f4df35cf34b\"] [\"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"d3b7d6f3-fd3c-5334-ae31-43e2c203f717\"] [\"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"c31ec379-7f62-522b-bb31-c0f9c9954c03\"] [\"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/choices \"ffc05d87-406b-5ad4-b0cd-67c7e9b3ccbc\"] [\"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\" :answer-field/correct \"470f23a0-c690-5c21-90fa-7cd4036c75c3\"] [\"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/id #uuid \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\"] [\"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\" :question/answer-fields \"9a2961c8-2e97-538a-939d-ebb005be6318\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"15d0a57a-da2d-543e-928d-7290d4d1d2ac\"] [\"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\" :answer/id #uuid \"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\"] [\"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\" :answer/id #uuid \"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\"] [\"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\" :answer/id #uuid \"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\"] [\"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\" :answer/id #uuid \"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\"] [\"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\" :answer/id #uuid \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\"] [\"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\"] [\"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"347fc161-b0b8-583b-b7e4-f6c9a663637b\"] [\"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"19416538-2c8c-5f95-b522-505565619b39\"] [\"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"cf4792ea-0ede-5041-8f43-8afd3895bace\"] [\"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"f12baf47-7210-586a-ad42-b09b2903d36f\"] [\"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/choices \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\"] [\"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\" :answer-field/correct \"83d06dd5-3711-5ddf-839f-4cb36c82e0b6\"] [\"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/id #uuid \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\"] [\"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{1}{2}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\" :question/answer-fields \"16088c81-94da-5f71-a408-6ddfc58a8106\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"1caba02f-6c79-5afe-bb8d-c39aa859627c\"] [\"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\" :answer/id #uuid \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\"] [\"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\" :answer/id #uuid \"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\"] [\"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{8}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\" :answer/id #uuid \"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\"] [\"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\" :answer/id #uuid \"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\"] [\"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{8}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\" :answer/id #uuid \"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\"] [\"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\"] [\"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\"] [\"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"e7d19abe-1109-5863-a74f-b3b55b6aa965\"] [\"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"f1bfddb3-0e50-5949-99e2-4c196b402e6e\"] [\"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"7783b814-51ff-5da3-907e-264b7bbff255\"] [\"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/choices \"c36f5946-f5d6-5e64-90c4-e7248877cc15\"] [\"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\" :answer-field/correct \"94bf3ab2-22ad-5e98-92e9-2a34d874b1b2\"] [\"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/id #uuid \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\"] [\"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=\\\\frac{3}{4}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|4 x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{4}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\" :question/answer-fields \"37ae52d7-a7a0-54d2-8b76-af2adf852891\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"d6d495dd-ff00-5509-a476-a4e8d3bd7010\"] [\"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\" :answer/id #uuid \"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\"] [\"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\" :answer/value \"- \\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\" :answer/id #uuid \"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\"] [\"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\" :answer/id #uuid \"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\"] [\"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{4}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\" :answer/id #uuid \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\"] [\"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\" :answer/id #uuid \"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\"] [\"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\"] [\"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"43499c08-05a9-5c0a-a784-2f181e4dddbe\"] [\"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"98a7d939-91ec-5810-bd2b-53125e67fefe\"] [\"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"02464a03-2fe9-54f3-9cff-f69da9f1d4bd\"] [\"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\"] [\"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/choices \"fd1cee2e-9a0e-51ee-97c5-bf3f9e79d462\"] [\"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\" :answer-field/correct \"2fe79904-eb97-5635-af60-58b705001e51\"] [\"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/id #uuid \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\"] [\"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=\\\\frac{2}{3}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|3 x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{2}{3}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\" :question/answer-fields \"1f30ccea-d5aa-593f-9ab0-03d03332d414\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"dc2b89d2-3f1d-598f-9dee-b47ad557ac71\"] [\"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\" :answer/id #uuid \"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\"] [\"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{6}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\" :answer/id #uuid \"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\"] [\"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\" :answer/id #uuid \"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\"] [\"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{5 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\" :answer/id #uuid \"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\"] [\"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{10}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\" :answer/id #uuid \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\"] [\"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\"] [\"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"43d75b11-521f-541f-bb3d-b41c77567a71\"] [\"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"d908a823-86c7-57d1-989e-20a2fe6a0459\"] [\"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"f3c327b9-2cc5-5c25-b125-511c8ebd6dd3\"] [\"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"281216a8-c2a6-5e78-bcb8-8fa7c9199625\"] [\"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/choices \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\"] [\"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\" :answer-field/correct \"a702e420-8be5-5e61-b034-376a9228f6f9\"] [\"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/id #uuid \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\"] [\"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=\\\\frac{3}{5}$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|5 x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\frac{3}{5}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [\"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\" :question/answer-fields \"9fe2bb80-1b22-5267-a056-32ca64e27dbe\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"8f0d9e41-8f56-57bb-a045-4ad94bb6b025\"] [\"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\" :answer/id #uuid \"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\"] [\"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\" :answer/id #uuid \"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\"] [\"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\" :answer/id #uuid \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\"] [\"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\" :answer/id #uuid \"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\"] [\"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\" :answer/id #uuid \"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\"] [\"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\"] [\"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"b61a6357-02f1-507f-8de3-753652bbc9a1\"] [\"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"03cf19a2-4124-5670-9eec-83da68368e5e\"] [\"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\"] [\"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"75b81eab-fe3e-57e8-afb1-925c526d5184\"] [\"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/choices \"241cb605-da66-54a7-94e1-77764294a6d2\"] [\"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\" :answer-field/correct \"3c16422f-38d1-5084-9fea-1cd9b82ce939\"] [\"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/id #uuid \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\"] [\"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $6\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\" :question/answer-fields \"5f347077-9659-5223-8abf-1b31ce341880\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"1cbe450c-ea4f-5a01-833d-55d5de5e577c\"] [\"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\" :answer/id #uuid \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\"] [\"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\" :answer/id #uuid \"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\"] [\"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\" :answer/id #uuid \"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\"] [\"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\" :answer/id #uuid \"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\"] [\"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\" :answer/id #uuid \"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\"] [\"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\"] [\"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\"] [\"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"55ffbc26-56fe-5e90-8428-008076d77b68\"] [\"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"425dd6cf-86d6-5037-805c-5eac2ea68cff\"] [\"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"e6e6ec96-45c8-5a3e-a5ed-9fa77fcccb14\"] [\"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/choices \"31c1cfc5-28b1-5b68-b47c-3c582793ee33\"] [\"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\" :answer-field/correct \"17c1363f-7f37-59dc-bcf3-fd39eb1f125b\"] [\"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/id #uuid \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\"] [\"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $4>0$, $|u|=4|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/4$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $12\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=3$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\" :question/answer-fields \"ed762e4d-6dd5-5490-8f7e-14ac4e31b6be\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"a5c4cc08-7b09-578f-bffb-3a2a7ab4cbd1\"] [\"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\" :answer/id #uuid \"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\"] [\"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\" :answer/value \"-2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\" :answer/id #uuid \"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\"] [\"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\" :answer/id #uuid \"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\"] [\"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{5 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\" :answer/id #uuid \"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\"] [\"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(10 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\" :answer/id #uuid \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\"] [\"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\"] [\"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"6b759f7d-5a15-5541-85ef-284c33e22b3f\"] [\"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"53a84070-1cb5-57f4-9609-c161da5bdbe7\"] [\"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"87ca676b-0308-5d98-b402-389066b036c2\"] [\"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"42d922c7-cc7e-5e70-895f-81c17a876417\"] [\"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/choices \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\"] [\"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\" :answer-field/correct \"08d31cf1-62d9-5849-b8d3-012fe820aac8\"] [\"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/id #uuid \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\"] [\"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $10\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=2$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{2}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\" :question/answer-fields \"30dc7a84-162e-59b5-a42f-53d385ff7811\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"37abf18f-59b7-5062-b961-a51a11c28165\"] [\"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\" :answer/id #uuid \"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\"] [\"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(8 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\" :answer/id #uuid \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\"] [\"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\" :answer/id #uuid \"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\"] [\"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\" :answer/id #uuid \"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\"] [\"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\" :answer/value \"8\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\" :answer/id #uuid \"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\"] [\"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\" :answer/value \"-4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\"] [\"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"3ddfb714-4f95-5467-9083-42089dd775f0\"] [\"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\"] [\"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"351ed49f-14d4-5ab8-8834-3c552570b0aa\"] [\"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"73b65ea5-c67c-55a1-92fe-5c9d51abcfa3\"] [\"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/choices \"71dfe8d6-2101-50c9-b2b2-10779be3e17c\"] [\"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\" :answer-field/correct \"85c788de-8f03-5db3-9b69-2c203036472d\"] [\"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/id #uuid \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\"] [\"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|4 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $4>0$, $|u|=4|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/4$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{4}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $16\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{4}=4$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{16 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\" :question/answer-fields \"351afa2e-10b1-517f-82c6-704c41912110\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"14926d50-c8af-5cab-9e50-b5e16906c80f\"] [\"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\" :answer/id #uuid \"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\"] [\"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\" :answer/id #uuid \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\"] [\"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\" :answer/id #uuid \"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\"] [\"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\" :answer/id #uuid \"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\"] [\"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\" :answer/value \"-1\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\" :answer/id #uuid \"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\"] [\"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(4 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\"] [\"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"b1da623c-2e0c-5a9b-a424-dfe1d824f0c3\"] [\"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\"] [\"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"bd3bc2b6-be7e-5afa-af48-b0af1220c340\"] [\"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"27322754-1126-563c-95da-98b4cf7e998a\"] [\"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/choices \"d9f6dff2-8146-5856-b8fb-495275393216\"] [\"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\" :answer-field/correct \"055086c5-6f13-5ad6-970e-1af6842a9f61\"] [\"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/id #uuid \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\"] [\"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|2 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $2>0$, $|u|=2|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/2$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{2}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{4 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(2 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\" :question/answer-fields \"99dbf1cc-a09e-5df6-8efb-0dd755797d1f\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"e6d570ea-5a06-5863-b191-7f1d5b757751\"] [\"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\" :answer/id #uuid \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\"] [\"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\" :answer/id #uuid \"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\"] [\"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\" :answer/id #uuid \"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\"] [\"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\" :answer/value \"2\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\" :answer/id #uuid \"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\"] [\"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\" :answer/value \"\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}+C\"] [\"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\" :answer/id #uuid \"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\"] [\"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\" :answer/value \"\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\"] [\"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\"] [\"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"b744d123-2f26-5a87-a35e-9f9424512c2c\"] [\"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"19b0401f-9b48-5e18-bb49-a9fb491c923d\"] [\"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"780b7457-ccdc-5bab-9d1d-2a24b46338f2\"] [\"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/choices \"bbad7e74-3cb2-57be-a3fe-aaeb2c9f38da\"] [\"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\" :answer-field/correct \"7e5a1d40-0c0d-51fc-8b5e-3ee190d24a6a\"] [\"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/id #uuid \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\"] [\"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $3\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=1$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u.\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\"] [\"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\" :question/answer-fields \"4740d65e-78a3-57c3-84a4-8d9196c424fc\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"1b8d8045-2521-5f4f-b1af-d5713f3765d6\"] [\"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\" :answer/id #uuid \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\"] [\"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\" :answer/id #uuid \"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\"] [\"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\" :answer/id #uuid \"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\"] [\"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\" :answer/value \"3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{5 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\" :answer/id #uuid \"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\"] [\"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\" :answer/value \"6\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\" :answer/id #uuid \"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\"] [\"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\" :answer/value \"-3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\"] [\"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\"] [\"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"3eac4463-c5be-574a-938d-0df69d3cdc1a\"] [\"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"c67e240f-7bdc-5e48-93bd-96c156defa1b\"] [\"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"00c82e82-89b1-526d-856f-786cc5c6b3db\"] [\"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/choices \"52ddac48-61f2-5735-8f2a-d157a2d474cb\"] [\"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\" :answer-field/correct \"52d87f59-c5fd-5fe8-93e4-565c100aa189\"] [\"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/id #uuid \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\"] [\"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=5 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(5)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|5 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $5>0$, $|u|=5|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/5$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{5}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $15\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{5}=3$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{3}{|x|\\\\sqrt{25 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n3\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(5 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\" :question/answer-fields \"5c9b6698-5b58-5d1f-a7ae-37162a7fec26\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"c09037c3-7c78-521a-be7b-f6e802c6d11b\"] [\"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\" :answer/id #uuid \"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\"] [\"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\" :answer/value \"-4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\" :answer/id #uuid \"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\"] [\"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\" :answer/value \"8\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\" :answer/id #uuid \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\"] [\"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\" :answer/id #uuid \"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\"] [\"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(6 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\" :answer/id #uuid \"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\"] [\"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [\"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\" :answer/value \"4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(\\\\frac{3 x}{2} \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C\"] [\"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/id #uuid \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\"] [\"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/key \"answer\"] [\"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [\"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"535fe772-f058-57ab-b2e0-8952481047d8\"] [\"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"a68738ed-9899-56d6-b02a-48ba8b866c2b\"] [\"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\"] [\"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"e633ee65-dc4a-5c89-ac15-960a24ba93a6\"] [\"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/choices \"bc0eb0d8-48b0-5c65-a977-ee443c1257bb\"] [\"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\" :answer-field/correct \"24485cb7-d90d-5ec5-81d9-657e2f0476b4\"] [\"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/id #uuid \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\"] [\"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/problem \"Find an antiderivative.\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\n$$\\n\\nWork on a connected interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nChoose the antiderivative. In each choice, $C$ is an arbitrary constant.\"] [\"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/worked-solution \"Let $u=3 x$. Then $\\\\mathrm{d}u=(3)\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x$.\\n\\nWork on a connected real interval where $|3 x|>1$.\\n\\nBecause $3>0$, $|u|=3|x|$, so $|x|=|u|/3$.\\n\\nThe differential is $\\\\mathrm{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{3}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $12\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{3}=4$.\\n\\nIncluding the differential factor gives\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}&\\\\int \\\\frac{4}{|x|\\\\sqrt{9 x^{2} - 1}}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}x\\\\\\\\&=4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right).\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\\n\\nUse the integration rule:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u=\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}+C.\\n$$\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{u^{2} - 1} \\\\left|{u}\\\\right|}\\\\,\\\\mathrm{d}u\\\\right)=4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(u \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\\n\\nSubstitute back:\\n\\n$$\\n4\\\\left(\\\\operatorname{arcsec}{\\\\left(3 x \\\\right)}\\\\right)+C.\\n$$\"] [\"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [\"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\" :question/answer-fields \"e88950ae-72ca-53a2-b232-019701118162\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/questions \"ce77e064-2ce6-5ce9-a443-8bef85a1034b\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/id #uuid \"60768809-3750-51be-a9aa-ab953c38eaa5\"] [\"generator\" :question-generator/script \"generators/74/74e3d64ae5c839f39554d463b26744edb4168c32b82da5d6a6aaf482d1a9c804/generator.py\"] [17592186064250 :knowledge-point/question-generator \"generator\"]] \"retractions\" [[17592186064250 :knowledge-point/question-generator 17592186680228]]}",
