\\\,⟹\\\\,\\\\text{d}x=\\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{2}}\\\\text{d}u.\\n$$\\n\\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\\n\\n$$\\n\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\begin{aligned}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|x|\\\\sqrt{2{x}^{2}-1}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x & =\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{2}}{|\\\\sqrt{2}x|\\\\sqrt{(\\\\sqrt{2}x)^{2}-1}}\\\\,\\\\text{d}x \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\sqrt{2}\\\\int \\\\frac{1}{|u|\\\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\\\cdot (\\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{2}}\\\\text{d}u) \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\sqrt{2}\\\\cdot \\\\frac{1}{\\\\sqrt{2}}\\\\int \\\\frac{\\\\text{d}u}{|u|\\\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\\\\\  & =\\\\text{arcsec}(\\\\sqrt{2}x)+C\\\\end{aligned}\\\\end{aligned}\\n$$\"} {:db/id 17592186250175 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid \"30f7223b-3eec-5940-8deb-7bc6e19cac0d\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\text{arcsec}\\\\left(\\\\frac{x}{\\\\sqrt{3}}\\\\right)+C\" :db/id 17592186247868} {:answer/id #uuid \"3d76b2e3-b64f-5ff7-9e80-9f8479c9c899\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\text{arcsec}(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247967} {:answer/id #uuid \"9bd42595-09d2-528a-bd27-8cbc87ecbf1d\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\frac{\\\\sqrt{3}}{3}\\\\text{arcsec}(x)+C\" :db/id 17592186248810} {:answer/id #uuid \"def281e2-ae26-5545-95a5-a8332aa49347\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\text{arcsec}(3x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249402} {:answer/id #uuid \"f9f3a636-5c31-5b0d-9342-5cf8e8d5dd79\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\sqrt{3}\\\\,\\\\text{arcsec}(x)+C\" :db/id 17592186249601}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid \"3d76b2e3-b64f-5ff7-9e80-9f8479c9c899\" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value \"\\\\text{arcsec}(\\\\sqrt{3}x)+C\" :db/id 17592186247967} :answer-field/id #uuid \"ad6f5e31-fa19-5c0b-8277-0506de476581\" :answer-field/key \"selection\" :answer-field/type {: